OL,3,CThousands of fish rescued after river
OL,4,Cdisappears down a sink hole in Surrey
OL,6,FThousands of fish have been rescued
OL,7,Fafter a three-mile stretch of river
OL,8,Fdisappeared down a sink hole.
OL,10,FThe fish became trapped in pools on
OL,11,Fthe dry bed of the River Mole in
OL,12,FSurrey.
OL,14,FEnvironment Agency officials used a
OL,15,Ftechnique called electric fishing to
OL,16,Fstun the fish and catch them in nets
OL,17,Fbefore moving them to safer waters
OL,18,Fupstream.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/6
