PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786616298
OL,3,CThousands of fish rescued after river
OL,4,Cdisappears down a sink hole in Surrey
OL,6,FDave Webb from the Environment Agency
OL,7,Fsaid: "The river runs through chalk
OL,8,Fand has disappeared in a sinkhole,
OL,9,Fleaving the riverbed dry.
OL,11,F"Normally, we would be up to our waist
OL,12,Fin water.
OL,14,F"In normal summer conditions, they can
OL,15,Fsurvive in these pools for quite a
OL,16,Fwhile, but over a period of time,
OL,17,Foxygen levels drop and the pools get
OL,18,Fsmaller.
OL,20,F"And this is made worse by extreme
OL,21,Fhigh temperatures."
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/6
