FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786616298
OL,3,CThousands of fish rescued after river
OL,4,Cdisappears down a sink hole in Surrey
OL,6,FA rare amber warning for "extreme
OL,7,Fheat" came into force for a swathe of
OL,8,FEngland as the UK could see the
OL,9,Fhottest day of the year so far.
OL,11,FTemperatures could reach 38C in some
OL,12,Fparts of England, in the fifth
OL,13,Fheatwave of what is on track to be a
OL,14,Frecord hot summer beating the previous
OL,15,Frecord set only last year.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
