OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786616298
OL,3,CThousands of fish rescued after river
OL,4,Cdisappears down a sink hole in Surrey
OL,6,FThe amber warning by the Met Office
OL,7,Ffor an area of England stretching from
OL,8,FLondon to Sheffield, covering parts of
OL,9,Fthe South East, East Midlands, East of
OL,10,FEngland, West Midlands and South
OL,11,FYorkshire, is in place from 9am to
OL,12,Fmidnight on Thursday.
OL,14,FIt comes after Prime Minister Andy
OL,15,FBurnham chaired a meeting of the
OL,16,FGovernment's emergency Cobra committee
OL,17,Fon Wednesday in response to the
OL,18,Fprolonged spell of exceptionally hot
OL,19,Fand dry weather.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786616298
OL,3,CThousands of fish rescued after river
OL,4,Cdisappears down a sink hole in Surrey
OL,6,FMet Office forecaster Alex Burkill
OL,7,Fsaid: "Temperatures (in areas covered
OL,8,Fby the amber warning) could reach
OL,9,Fhighs of around 36, 37, possibly 38C.
OL,11,F"Now when you get these sorts of high
OL,12,Ftemperatures, well that's when we
OL,13,Fcould see impacts to our
OL,14,Finfrastructure, our railway lines, our
OL,15,Froads, they are not designed for this
OL,16,Fsort of heat.
OL,18,F"And more people are likely to be
OL,19,Fimpacted by how hot it is with regards
OL,20,Fto their health."
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
