OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1786616298
OL,3,CThousands of fish rescued after river
OL,4,Cdisappears down a sink hole in Surrey
OL,6,FHe added: "It could be the hottest day
OL,7,Fof the year so far if we get above
OL,8,F38C, and if we get above 38.5C, well
OL,9,Fit could be the hottest August day on
OL,10,Frecord, but that's actually pretty
OL,11,Funlikely."
